# BrailleSense is a Korean braille notetaker line by HIMS that accepts 8-dot
# computer braille input for punctuation, often as two- or three-cell
# sequences. This table back-translates such sequences to Unicode
# punctuation, alongside a forward Korean translation table (e.g. ko-g2.ctb).

